      "id": "5a6473b5-9b0c-4923-a5a5-16513a631ef2",
      "name": "Bundle Component Products Relationships",
      "description": {
        "content": "With Product Experience Manager, you can create and manage bundles. A bundle is a purchasable product, consisting of one or more products that you want to sell together.\n\nYou can create multiple components within a bundle. Each component must have at least one or more options. Each option is a product and a quantity.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
